{"id":"43bf0ac6633013d5","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-sld-resolution.md","title":"SLD-Resolution","display":"df-sld-resolution — SLD-Resolution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-sld-resolution","aliases":["57-df-sld-resolution"],"display":"df-sld-resolution — SLD-Resolution","depends_on":["[[57-df-definite-program]]","[[57-df-horn-clause]]","[[57-df-goal-clause]]","[[57-df-substitution]]","[[57-df-substitution-application]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]","[[57-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-sld-resolution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-sld-resolution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sld-resolution — SLD-Resolution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c234c1cfaaa63dac\" href=\"?note=c234c1cfaaa63dac\" title=\"57-df-definite-program\">57-df-definite-program</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"116e7c4b27a69d8e\" href=\"?note=116e7c4b27a69d8e\" title=\"57-df-horn-clause\">57-df-horn-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"20aaef29b45de654\" href=\"?note=20aaef29b45de654\" title=\"57-df-goal-clause\">57-df-goal-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d1b845cf0812591a\" href=\"?note=d1b845cf0812591a\" title=\"57-df-substitution\">57-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fcdd3e992e132d58\" href=\"?note=fcdd3e992e132d58\" title=\"57-df-substitution-application\">57-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\in\\mathrm{GoalCl}\">\\(G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\in\\mathrm{GoalCl}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq i\\leq k\">\\(1\\leq i\\leq k\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c234c1cfaaa63dac\" href=\"?note=c234c1cfaaa63dac\" title=\"57-df-definite-program\">57-df-definite-program</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"116e7c4b27a69d8e\" href=\"?note=116e7c4b27a69d8e\" title=\"57-df-horn-clause\">57-df-horn-clause</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"20aaef29b45de654\" href=\"?note=20aaef29b45de654\" title=\"57-df-goal-clause\">57-df-goal-clause</a>。作为状态的目标原子列随 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 显式固定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\eta,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\">\\(\\theta,\\eta,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta\">\\(\\widehat\\theta\\)</span> 是域外恒等延拓；项与原子代换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d1b845cf0812591a\" href=\"?note=d1b845cf0812591a\" title=\"57-df-substitution\">57-df-substitution</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"fcdd3e992e132d58\" href=\"?note=fcdd3e992e132d58\" title=\"57-df-substitution-application\">57-df-substitution-application</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Apart}(\\rho,V,G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Apart}(\\rho,V,G)\\)</span> 是下述标准化改名谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)\">\\(\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)\\)</span> 是带代换标记的有限反驳集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)\">\\(\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)\\)</span> 是其在初始目标变量上的复合答案。复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\star\\eta\">\\(\\theta\\star\\eta\\)</span> 先作用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 再作用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\theta\">\\(G\\theta\\)</span> 的使用表示先对其显式目标列中各原子作代换，再按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"20aaef29b45de654\" href=\"?note=20aaef29b45de654\" title=\"57-df-goal-clause\">57-df-goal-clause</a> 闭包，而不是对已闭合句子作自由代入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}\">\\(\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"20aaef29b45de654\" href=\"?note=20aaef29b45de654\" title=\"57-df-goal-clause\">57-df-goal-clause</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{len}\">\\(\\operatorname{len}\\)</span> 与从零起编号的列应用是集合论有限列操作。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 在反驳和答案集合中也允许为空目标；步骤关系只用于非空目标。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fold}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fold}\\)</span> 是下述代换列复合函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SLD}\">\\(\\mathrm{SLD}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Apart}(\\rho,V,G)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho)=V\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;(\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\to x=y)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)\\cap\\mathrm{FV}(\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(G)))=\\emptyset.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Apart}(\\rho,V,G)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho)=V\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;(\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\to x=y)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)\\cap\\mathrm{FV}(\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(G)))=\\emptyset.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nG\\xrightarrow[P,\\theta]{A_i}G&#39;\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists H,B_1,\\ldots,B_m\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\;[&amp;H\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_m\\in P\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Apart}(\\rho,\\mathrm{FV}(\\{H,B_1,\\ldots,B_m\\}),G)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land A_i\\theta=(H\\rho)\\theta\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land G&#39;=\\leftarrow A_1\\theta,\\ldots,A_{i-1}\\theta,(B_1\\rho)\\theta,\\ldots,(B_m\\rho)\\theta,A_{i+1}\\theta,\\ldots,A_k\\theta].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nG\\xrightarrow[P,\\theta]{A_i}G&#39;\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists H,B_1,\\ldots,B_m\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\;[&amp;H\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_m\\in P\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Apart}(\\rho,\\mathrm{FV}(\\{H,B_1,\\ldots,B_m\\}),G)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land A_i\\theta=(H\\rho)\\theta\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land G&#39;=\\leftarrow A_1\\theta,\\ldots,A_{i-1}\\theta,(B_1\\rho)\\theta,\\ldots,(B_m\\rho)\\theta,A_{i+1}\\theta,\\ldots,A_k\\theta].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\star\\eta\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,(\\widehat\\theta(x))\\eta\\rangle:\nx\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\eta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta\\star\\eta\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,(\\widehat\\theta(x))\\eta\\rangle:\nx\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\eta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fold}(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Fold}(\\langle\\theta_1,\\ldots,\\theta_r,\\eta\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fold}(\\langle\\theta_1,\\ldots,\\theta_r\\rangle)\\star\\eta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fold}(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Fold}(\\langle\\theta_1,\\ldots,\\theta_r,\\eta\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fold}(\\langle\\theta_1,\\ldots,\\theta_r\\rangle)\\star\\eta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle g,h,i\\rangle\\in\n\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{GoalCl}^{r+1}\\times\\mathrm{Subst}_S^r\\times\\mathbb N^r):\\quad&amp;\ng(0)=G\\land g(\\operatorname{len}(h))=(\\leftarrow)\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{len}(h)\\;[&amp;1\\leq i(j)\\leq\\operatorname{len}(\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(g(j)))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land g(j)\\xrightarrow[P,h(j)]{\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(g(j))(i(j)-1)}g(j+1)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle g,h,i\\rangle\\in\n\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{GoalCl}^{r+1}\\times\\mathrm{Subst}_S^r\\times\\mathbb N^r):\\quad&amp;\ng(0)=G\\land g(\\operatorname{len}(h))=(\\leftarrow)\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall j&lt;\\operatorname{len}(h)\\;[&amp;1\\leq i(j)\\leq\\operatorname{len}(\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(g(j)))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land g(j)\\xrightarrow[P,h(j)]{\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(g(j))(i(j)-1)}g(j+1)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Fold}(h)\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}\\mathrm{FV}(\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(G))):\n\\exists g,i\\;\\langle g,h,i\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Fold}(h)\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}\\mathrm{FV}(\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(G))):\n\\exists g,i\\;\\langle g,h,i\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SLD}}A\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,(\\leftarrow A))\\neq\\emptyset.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SLD}}A\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,(\\leftarrow A))\\neq\\emptyset.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>反驳中每一步重新声明源子句和改名，不再依赖无法从谓词参数恢复的外部 C；初始目标已涉及的变量不会与新子句变量误合并。空复合取空代换；复合左结合，答案代换域外仍按恒等解释。保留任意合一代换的原约定，没有把接口改成必须选某一个 mgu。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-definite-program","status":"resolved","id":"c234c1cfaaa63dac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-definite-program]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-horn-clause","status":"resolved","id":"116e7c4b27a69d8e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-horn-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-goal-clause","status":"resolved","id":"20aaef29b45de654","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-goal-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"d1b845cf0812591a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"fcdd3e992e132d58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-definite-program","status":"resolved","id":"c234c1cfaaa63dac","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\in\\mathrm{GoalCl}$，$k\\geq1$，$1\\leq i\\leq k$；见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-horn-clause]]、[[57-df-goal-clause]]。作为状态的目标原子列随 $G$ 显式固定。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-horn-clause","status":"resolved","id":"116e7c4b27a69d8e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\in\\mathrm{GoalCl}$，$k\\geq1$，$1\\leq i\\leq k$；见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-horn-clause]]、[[57-df-goal-clause]]。作为状态的目标原子列随 $G$ 显式固定。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-goal-clause","status":"resolved","id":"20aaef29b45de654","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\in\\mathrm{GoalCl}$，$k\\geq1$，$1\\leq i\\leq k$；见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-horn-clause]]、[[57-df-goal-clause]]。作为状态的目标原子列随 $G$ 显式固定。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"d1b845cf0812591a","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta,\\eta,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S$，$\\widehat\\theta$ 是域外恒等延拓；项与原子代换见 [[57-df-substitution]]、[[57-df-substitution-application]]、[[57-df-term]]。$\\mathrm{FV}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"fcdd3e992e132d58","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta,\\eta,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S$，$\\widehat\\theta$ 是域外恒等延拓；项与原子代换见 [[57-df-substitution]]、[[57-df-substitution-application]]、[[57-df-term]]。$\\mathrm{FV}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta,\\eta,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S$，$\\widehat\\theta$ 是域外恒等延拓；项与原子代换见 [[57-df-substitution]]、[[57-df-substitution-application]]、[[57-df-term]]。$\\mathrm{FV}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta,\\eta,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S$，$\\widehat\\theta$ 是域外恒等延拓；项与原子代换见 [[57-df-substitution]]、[[57-df-substitution-application]]、[[57-df-term]]。$\\mathrm{FV}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-goal-clause","status":"resolved","id":"20aaef29b45de654","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对目标 $G\\theta$ 的使用表示先对其显式目标列中各原子作代换，再按 [[57-df-goal-clause]] 闭包，而不是对已闭合句子作自由代入。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-goal-clause","status":"resolved","id":"20aaef29b45de654","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}$ 见 [[57-df-goal-clause]]；$\\operatorname{len}$ 与从零起编号的列应用是集合论有限列操作。$G$ 在反驳和答案集合中也允许为空目标；步骤关系只用于非空目标。$\\mathrm{Fold}$ 是下述代换列复合函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}","display":false},{"tex":"G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\in\\mathrm{GoalCl}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"1\\leq i\\leq k","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta,\\eta,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Apart}(\\rho,V,G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\star\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"G\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{len}","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fold}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SLD}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Apart}(\\rho,V,G)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho)=V\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;(\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\to x=y)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\rho)\\cap\\mathrm{FV}(\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(G)))=\\emptyset.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nG\\xrightarrow[P,\\theta]{A_i}G'\\leftrightarrow\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists H,B_1,\\ldots,B_m\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\;[&H\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_m\\in P\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Apart}(\\rho,\\mathrm{FV}(\\{H,B_1,\\ldots,B_m\\}),G)\\\\\n&{}\\land A_i\\theta=(H\\rho)\\theta\\\\\n&{}\\land G'=\\leftarrow A_1\\theta,\\ldots,A_{i-1}\\theta,(B_1\\rho)\\theta,\\ldots,(B_m\\rho)\\theta,A_{i+1}\\theta,\\ldots,A_k\\theta].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta\\star\\eta\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,(\\widehat\\theta(x))\\eta\\rangle:\nx\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\theta)\\cup\\operatorname{dom}(\\eta)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fold}(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Fold}(\\langle\\theta_1,\\ldots,\\theta_r,\\eta\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fold}(\\langle\\theta_1,\\ldots,\\theta_r\\rangle)\\star\\eta.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle g,h,i\\rangle\\in\n\\bigcup_{r\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{GoalCl}^{r+1}\\times\\mathrm{Subst}_S^r\\times\\mathbb N^r):\\quad&\ng(0)=G\\land g(\\operatorname{len}(h))=(\\leftarrow)\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall j<\\operatorname{len}(h)\\;[&1\\leq i(j)\\leq\\operatorname{len}(\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(g(j)))\\\\\n&{}\\land g(j)\\xrightarrow[P,h(j)]{\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(g(j))(i(j)-1)}g(j+1)]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Fold}(h)\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}\\mathrm{FV}(\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{GoalAtoms}(G))):\n\\exists g,i\\;\\langle g,h,i\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"P\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SLD}}A\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,(\\leftarrow A))\\neq\\emptyset.","display":true}],"bytes":4033,"backlinks":[{"id":"f7fdeadb93806ad7","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-atomic-formula]]。$P\\vdash_{\\mathrm{SLD}}A\\sigma$ 见 [[57-df-sld-resolution]]；$\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S$、$\\mathrm{FV}$ 见 [[57-df-ground-substitution]]、[[57-df-free-variable]]。本文件保持原本“没有成功的基实例反驳”的语义定义，不改为某一具体搜索策略的有限失败。"},{"id":"d2f6edd30be06d05","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)$ 为显式有序目标，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-goal-clause]]。$\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)$、$\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)$ 见 [[57-df-sld-resolution]]；原无参数 $\\mathrm{CAS}$ 在当前固定 $P,G$ 环境下是这个集合的缩写。所有程序和目标矩阵原子均为关系符号应用，不含内建等号；假定 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]] 的 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset$。$\\mathrm{UC},\\mathrm{And}$ 和逻辑后承见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]、[[57-df-logical-consequence]]。"},{"id":"e64933cc4ccfc533","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)$ 为显式有序目标，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-goal-clause]]。$\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)$、$\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)$ 见 [[57-df-sld-resolution]]；原无参数 $\\mathrm{CAS}$ 在当前固定 $P,G$ 环境下是这个集合的缩写。所有程序和目标矩阵原子均为关系符号应用，不含内建等号；假定 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]] 的 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset$。$\\mathrm{UC},\\mathrm{And}$ 和逻辑后承见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]、[[57-df-logical-consequence]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[57-df-sld-resolution]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-righ